## Content Localization Guidelines

- **India/Nepal**: Use Sanskrit terms (Kundli, Nakshatra, Tithi) as primary, with English explanations
- **South Africa/Nigeria/Kenya**: Lead with English terms (birth chart, horoscope, compatibility)
- **Bangladesh/Sri Lanka**: Vedic terms work, English content acceptable
- **Brazil**: Portuguese Western terms (mapa astral, horóscopo, compatibilidade). See /pt/ locale.
- **Mexico/Argentina/Spain/LatAm**: Spanish Western terms. "Carta astral" in Spain/Mexico, "carta natal" in Argentina. Love + Chinese horoscope dominant in Argentina. 97% mobile traffic.
- **Japan**: Western zodiac terms (星座占い, ホロスコープ, アセンダント). Katakana for Vedic loanwords. Daily fortune (今日の運勢) is a habit search — ranking format expected. Love queries = 85% of paid fortune usage.
- **France/Belgium/Switzerland/Quebec**: French Western terms (horoscope du jour, thème astral, carte du ciel, compatibilité, synastrie). "Ascendant" is the original French word. 88% mobile traffic. Metropolitan French; avoid Quebec-only expressions. Heures miroirs (11:11, 22:22) uniquely popular.
- **Global English**: Always have English as the canonical version
